  "abstract": "This submission conducts an ablation study on the `context_dim` hyperparameter for the Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP. It evaluates an increased `context_dim` of 32 (compared to 16 in Eval ID 82) to assess the impact of a richer context representation on forecasting accuracy for the ZAPBench dataset, aiming to better capture implicit condition information.",
